  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Stakeholder Capacities in Business and Human Rights: Ensuring Accountability and Access  to Remedy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen access to justice and respect for human rights in Zambia&#x2019;s business sector, with a particular focus on the extractive and resource-intensive industries. It seeks to address persistent gaps in accountability, access to remedy, and institutional coordination by enhancing the capacity of the Human Rights Commission (HRC) and supporting inclusive grievance redress mechanisms. Grounded in a people-centered approach, the project will empower affected communities through</narrative>
  </description>
